  "bodyHash": "xUhcLIN7P90=",
  "content": "你好世界<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enderzoology/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enderzoology/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://x.com/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Fuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enderzoology/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">終界生物學為你的世界帶來了全新的刺激與危險！你將面對兇猛的新生物，例如狡猾的終界迷你、致命的墮落騎士，以及扭曲的凋零女巫——每種生物都帶來獨特的混亂。探索被恐狼獵捕的雪地森林，並運用貓頭鷹的力量從高處俯瞰下方的危險。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">製作傳送爆炸物、釀造詛咒藥水，並解鎖如靈魂綁定和驅逐等改變遊戲規則的附魔，以保護自己免受這些敵對新威脅的侵害。有了新生物、致命戰利品和令人費解的效果，你世界的每個角落都潛藏著恐怖——而每一場冒險都將帶來新的挑戰。準備好進入一個危險不僅僅是注視著你……而是正在移動的世界。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enderzoology/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌌 新生物</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧍‍♂️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">終界迷你</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：小巧但兇猛！這些小終界使者攻擊力驚人，而且喜歡追逐</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">震盪爬行者</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">💥 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">震盪爬行者</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：爆炸時不會破壞方塊——而是會傳送你！掉落</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">迷惑粉</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，可用於製作特殊TNT變種。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⚔️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">墮落騎士</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：致命的不死戰士，有時騎乘邪惡坐騎！擊敗他們可獲得強大的</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">狩獵弓</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🐎 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">墮落坐騎</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：由</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">墮落騎士</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">騎乘的兇猛殭屍馬。治癒牠即可擁有你自己的黑暗戰馬！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧙‍♀️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">凋零女巫</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：邪惡的女巫，會施加凋零效果！擊敗她們可從</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">凋零塵</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">中釀造強大的</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">腐敗藥水</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🐱 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">凋零貓</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：可愛？再想想。這些兇惡的貓咪保護著凋零女巫，攻擊迅速！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧟‍♂️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感染殭屍</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：終界使者與殭屍的混合體，攻擊時會傳送你！極低機率掉落獨特的附魔書。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🐺 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">恐狼</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：雪地森林變得更加危險！小心他們發紅光的眼睛！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🦉 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">貓頭鷹</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px />：友善的森林夥伴，會攻擊蜘蛛。掉落</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">貓頭鷹蛋</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，可用於釀造</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">上升藥水</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🛠️ 新物品</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🎇 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">迷惑粉</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：製作強大的傳送主題炸藥！由</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">震盪爬行者</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">掉落。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧪 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">凋零塵</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：釀造強效</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">腐敗藥水</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，扭轉戰局！由</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">凋零女巫</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">掉落。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🏹 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">狩獵弓</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：可使用弓與弩的升級附魔，如快速裝填和多重射擊。由</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">墮落騎士</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">低機率掉落。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">✨ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">終界碎片</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：組合以製作你自己的</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">終界珍珠</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">！由</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">終界迷你</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">掉落。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🥚 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">貓頭鷹蛋</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：釀造</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">上升藥水</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，翱翔天際！由</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">貓頭鷹</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">掉落。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧪 新附魔</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">📜 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">靈魂綁定</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：死亡後保留物品，但觸發時等級可能會下降。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⚔️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">腐敗</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 和 🏹 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">凋零</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：對目標施加致命的凋零效果。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🚪 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">驅逐</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：受到攻擊時將攻擊者傳送走，模仿感染殭屍的詭計！</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧪 新藥水</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌀 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">位移</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：隨機傳送實體。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🖤 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">腐敗</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：施加致命的凋零效果。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🤯 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">迷惑</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：施加噁心效果以迷惑敵人。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🕊️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">上升</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：賦予漂浮效果，讓你升入空中。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enderzoology/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enderzoology/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enderzoology/media/2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enderzoology/media/3.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enderzoology/media/4.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enderzoology/media/5.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enderzoology/media/6.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enderzoology/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">客戶端與伺服器端皆需安裝</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/puzzles-lib\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（FABRIC 和 NEOFORGE）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（FABRIC）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/forge-config-api-port\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（FABRIC）</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enderzoology/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">如果模組支援，可直接從遊戲內使用模組選單進行設定（在 Fabric 上需要安裝 </span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Mod Menu</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，作者 </span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Prospector\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Prospector</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">）。請注意，在較舊的 Minecraft 版本中，還需要安裝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Forge Config Screens</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">若要使用外部文字編輯器手動設定，所有設定檔都位於 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 資料夾，檔案名稱分別為 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 或 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（視設定類型而定）。並非所有類型都存在於模組中。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enderzoology/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 非常感謝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/crazypants_mc_the_second\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">CrazyPants</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 製作了 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ender-zoo\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Ender Zoo</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 模組，我非常喜愛它，並極力希望能將其帶回現代 Minecraft 版本，讓新一代玩家體驗。幾乎所有程式碼都是重新撰寫的，這意味著，特別是生物行為等方面，會與舊模組有所不同。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 衷心感謝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/tamlighter\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Tamlighter</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 創作了所有這些令人驚豔的新材質。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enderzoology/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/ytones\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/ytones/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/easy-shulker-boxes\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/enchanting-infuser\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enchantinginfuser/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enderzoology/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enderzoology/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>",
